  triage:verifiedInRound "qa-pr1269-r3" ;
  triage:resolutionNote "On feature/ay2-herdr-transport-seam only (arch-ctm AY2-FIX-R3): transport_fixture.rs's fixture tests now thread each manifest's declared mode/delta into FAKE_HERDR_MODE/FAKE_HERDR_DELTA and drive the real HerdrProcessInvoker/CliIo/decode_envelope path, asserting mode-specific outcomes rather than bare success. Confirmed by req-qa (direct read of transport_fixture.rs:51-153). Finding-level status stays fixed_partial: the integrate/phase-ay and feature/ay3-herdr-endpoint-doctor-config occurrences have not merged this fix forward. Note: passing locally does not mean these tests run in CI -- see AY2-QA-008 (new, Blocking) for the separate CI-coverage gap." .